","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2019-01-09T00:38:42Z","updated_at":"2019-01-31T18:30:27Z","closed_at":"2019-01-31T18:30:27Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"The read operations within SQL statement should use a consistent read snapshot.\r\n\r\nFor example, the select portion of insert-select operation should read rows as of the start of SQL statement.\r\nTest case below shows the issue where insert-select ends up with more than 2x the number of the rows.\r\n\r\n```sql\r\ncreate table test2 (a text, b int);\r\n\r\ninsert into test2 values ('abc', 1);\r\n\r\nINSERT 0 1\r\n\r\ninsert into test2 select * from test2;   -- BUG shows 3 rows being inserted instead of just 1 row\r\n\r\nINSERT 0 3\r\n\r\nselect count(a) from test2;\r\n\r\n count \r\n-------\r\n     4\r\n(1 row)\r\n\r\nselect * from test2;\r\n  a  | b \r\n-----+---\r\n abc | 1\r\n abc | 1\r\n abc | 1\r\n abc | 1\r\n(4 rows)\r\n```\r\n\r\nSometimes it may take a few repeated insert..select before the bug manifests (due to the nature of internally generated OIDs that determines tablet mappings).\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"spolitov","id":891914,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5MTkxNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/891914?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov","html_url":"https://github.com/spolitov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/723/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/723/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}